your plan going forward?

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.000
Well...

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.500
We're gonna look for Brother!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:20.040
The Seal Center is one idea.
All of Kansai's info goes through it.

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:22.540
If we can just sneak in somehow...

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:25.870
I used to work there! If we use my seal, we--

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:31.950
Your seal is useless now.
You're an S-Rank Akudama, you know.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:36.330
Yeah, I am...

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.870
Big Sis?

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:43.120
But it's the only way to
find out Brother's location!

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:47.370
We have no other choice!
If seals won't work, the back door--

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.910
Is your head full of shit?

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:52.040
--Wha--?!
--Big Sis isn't full of shit!

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:56.410
You should know it's impossible
better than anyone.

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:59.200
You're gifted at shattering hopes.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:03.580
It sure would be nice to have
Hacker right about now.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:06.370
Well, he's not here, is he?

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:10.750
Think. There're better ways
to find out Brother's location.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:12.080
Huh?

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:19.620
Where is he? Who took him away?

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:20.790
Executioners!

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:23.950
If anyone knows where he's at, it's them.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:28.330
