into their headquarters?

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:31.750
That place is a death trap. It's too dangerous.

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:35.790
When has that mattered? We're Akudama.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:39.410
"South Ward"
"Back Alley"

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:40.790
