"Back Alley"

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:40.790
Red...

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:46.040
Red... Red... Red...

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:54.080
Red... Red... Red... Red!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.290
"Kansai North Ward"
"Five-Star Hotel   Mt. Fuji Trough"

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:08.950
Why did you... with me?

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:12.000
Do you think it meant anything?

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.040
No, but...

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:20.580
There's no meaning behind it.
I'm just being true to myself, that's all.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:24.790
Is getting those brats
being true to yourself, too?

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:28.830
You trying to become immortal or something?

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:33.200
The way I see it,
you're immortal enough already.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:39.000
Such mind-boggling ignorance.
How can you be so thoughtless?

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:45.330
I have zero interest in that.
Life that never dies is defective.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:47.000
What? Huh?

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:51.250
There's only one thing that matters--control.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:54.330
My goal is complete control.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:59.160
But for living beings,
there's one thing we can't control.

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:00.700
Death.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:01.620
Death?

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:09.120
I want to control the death of all
living things, including my own.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:14.250
Till now, I've tried nearly everything
to manipulate death.

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:20.790
Medicines from around the world...
Advanced surgeries of every kind...

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:24.660
But death remains something I can't control.

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:30.120
Do you have any idea how long
I've spent on this ambition?

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:34.250
And yet, death continues to refuse my will.

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:39.450
Do I look like someone that
will let something defy me?

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:43.000
And then, those kids appeared.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:47.870
Children with cells that can infinitely divide.

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:52.080
If I study them, perhaps I can manipulate death.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:57.750
When I say "live," things live.
When I say "die," they instantly die.

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:01.330
All life will obey my will.

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:13.200
What desire could be sweeter than that?

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:16.200
Y-You always blow my mind.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:21.450
I'm glad you enjoyed it. By the way,
how old do you think I look?

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:22.290
Huh?

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:24.910
Do you see me as a woman?

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:26.910
Huh?!

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:28.290
Um...

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:37.040
That's...

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:48.080
The marker moved. We should chase--
Huh? What's going on?

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.500
What the hell?

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:58.500
It seems that something has begun.

00:08:58.500 --> 00:08:59.580
What is it?

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.160
There's an uprising of civilians.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:06.370
People calling themselves vigilantes
are killing Akudama.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:10.250
Once one is found, they're being beaten by mobs.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:11.950
What started this?

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:17.080
"I am Swindler. In less than 12 hours,
the Akudama will assemble and conquer Kansai."
A few hours ago, someone claiming
to be Swindler posted online.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:20.330
"I am Swindler. In less than 12 hours,
the Akudama will assemble and conquer Kansai."
Following that, there were
sightings of Swindler.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:24.540
We've received reports
of Cutthroat killings as well.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:29.950
These events have essentially
lit the fire of Akudama hatred.

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:32.450
This is such terrible timing.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:35.250
Manage the situation as best you can.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:40.450
I'm heading to the station.
That useless puppet police chief wants help.

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:43.080
Don't let him drive you crazy.

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:53.250
Whoa... It turned into a big deal.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.250
You manipulate people?

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:56.750
As if!

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.080
I thought people would take notice
since I was seen in town,

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:00.370
"I am Swindler. In less than 12 hours,
the Akudama will assemble and conquer Kansai."
I thought people would take notice
since I was seen in town,

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:03.160
"I am Swindler. In less than 12 hours,
the Akudama will assemble and conquer Kansai."
so I wrote something crazy online.

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:07.450
