00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:10.830
People have made me into a pretty big deal!

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:13.330
I could get used to this.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:18.660
Just goes to show you how much
the people of Kansai hate Akudama.

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:19.950
