Is Swindler really leading the Akudama?

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:31.160
Not sure, but I heard a group of 'em
is heading to the station!

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:34.830
Hey! Cutthroat killed people south of here!

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:38.200
What the hell's going on with Kansai?!

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.290
It's pretty! So pretty!

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:43.410
Look at it sparkle!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.950
Hey, you! Get outta here!

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:49.750
It's him! It's Cutthroat!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:57.330
It's incredible!

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.620
I can't wait for it!

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:03.910
"Execution Department"

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:10.330
