00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.200
The Akudama aren't--

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:46.540
Men are useless. They're cowards
only when it suits them.

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:47.160
--That's not--

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:48.500
