are rioting as we speak!
--That's not--

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:51.370
--The citizens you want to defend
are rioting as we speak!

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:54.830
I wanted to avoid a situation like this.

00:11:56.080 --> 00:12:03.120
After failing to execute Cutthroat,
seven Akudama attacked the <i>Shinkansen</i>.

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:09.160
Attacking an object of worship
bred contempt towards Akudama.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:12.160
And then we issued a large-scale search.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:19.200
It was done to smoke out the seven Akudama,
but it solidified people's fear of them.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:23.410
To top it off, Swindler makes
an absurd statement

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:26.450
that she's gathering Akudama
to declare war on Kansai,

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:29.910
followed by Cutthroat's killing spree.

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:34.250
Civil unrest was a bomb waiting to happen.

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:38.620
Why did this have to happen when I'm chief?

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:40.830
This is no time to cry.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:45.330
The Kansai Police need to
shut this down immediately.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:51.370
As long as I'm the boss, I will not
let the Akudama get their way!

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:55.410
--Emergency alert! Akudama have invaded
the Execution Department HQ!

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:56.870
--What?!
--Emergency alert! Akudama have invaded
the Execution Department HQ!

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.950
