00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:30.700
It sure is quiet here. There's no one in sight.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:39.750
Wh-What's that foul stench?

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.200
It's him.

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:58.790
You're finally here! Look!
I decorated the place just for you!

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:01.700
Cutthroat...

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:06.040
Ah... I might just melt seeing it up close!

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:09.830
It's so dazzling! So pretty!

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:12.950
Can I kill you?

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:16.250
My cake for Swindler!

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:21.540
That's mean! Why'd you do that?!
It took forever to stack 'em!

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:31.750
You're the one who came to me! I'm so happy!

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:35.750
Ah... It's so beautiful!

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:40.290
--I've been waiting forever...
for your red angel halo to grow!

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:41.450
